msgid "Keep a discussion catalog"
msgstr ""

#: ../../howto/discussions.rst:4
msgid "A discussion catalog keeps proposals and decisions. Each discussion is one reStructuredText record. A record gets a number when it opens for review, and its state says where the decision stands. Guidedog's own design records, GDS, are one such catalog. This page uses ``dsc``."
msgstr ""

