#: ../../howto/maintain-docs.rst:4
msgid "There are three Guidedog projects: ``docs/manual``, ``docs/api``, and ``docs/gds``. The manual and GDS began with ``guidedog quickstart``. Edit their generated templates in place. Do not place design records in the manual's table of contents."
